 "description": "Fit original tracks, then rank 1\u201364 supplied future series by local-linear uncertainty and declared cost. Assumes constant velocity, independent new errors and exact stations/clocks. Candidate angles and client baselines are forbidden. Prediction is not an acquired measurement or visibility proof.",
 "execution": {
  "taskSupport": "forbidden"
 },
